## SQ-WGE-10 | C3: no crimson / warped trapdoor, button, slab, plate, stairs, stripped hyphae in the 9 placed structures
> save-all flush
waitlog Saved the game 300
shell python3 -I $INST/tools/scratch_query/region_blocks.py blocks wge 'minecraft:(crimson|warped)_(trapdoor|button|slab|pressure_plate|stairs)$|minecraft:stripped_warped_hyphae$' --box -6128 -6128 -2673 -5873 | head -4
shell python3 -I $INST/tools/scratch_query/region_blocks.py blocks wge 'minecraft:(mangrove_(trapdoor|button|slab)|dark_oak_(pressure_plate|trapdoor|stairs)|stripped_dark_oak_wood)$' --box -6128 -6128 -2673 -5873 | head -4
shell n=$(python3 -I $INST/tools/scratch_query/region_blocks.py blocks wge 'minecraft:(crimson|warped)_(trapdoor|button|slab|pressure_plate|stairs)$|minecraft:stripped_warped_hyphae$' --box -6128 -6128 -2673 -5873 | sed -n 's/.*: \([0-9]*\) in .*/\1/p'); echo "old blocks $n"; [ "$n" = 0 ]
look mangrove / dark oak replacements counted above 0; facing, half, open and axis as before and the desert temple 24-plate puzzle: client look at -5600 -6000 (temple) and the other placed spots (x -6000 + 400 n, z -6000)
