## SQ-WGE-11 | C4, C5: camp ruin metas x1.7, tower siege x0.6, meteor shower x0.66; anchors unchanged (census)
> celocate census 96 2144 -2592
waitlog \[celocate\] census done 3600
shell cp kubejs/exported/worldgen/locate_census.json $INST/perf/runs/r1103w/w/w12_census_r1031centre.json && echo copied
shell for f in $INST/perf/runs/r1103w/w/w1_census_0_0.json $INST/perf/runs/r1103w/w/w1_census_4k.json $INST/perf/runs/r1103w/w/w12_census_r1031centre.json $INST/perf/runs/r1031/w1b_locate_census.json $INST/perf/runs/r1101/w2_locate_census.json; do python3 -c "import json,sys; d=json.load(open(sys.argv[1])); print(sys.argv[1].split('/')[-1], d['centerChunk'], 'r', d['radiusChunks']); [print('  ', s['structure'], 'slots', s['slots'], 'built', s['built'], 'known', s['known']) for s in d['structures'] if any(k in s['structure'] for k in ('pillager_camp_ruin', 'great_tower', 'meteor_shower', 'ae2:meteorite', 'eugene:pillager_camp', 'pillager_great_tower'))]" $f; done
look known/slots of meta/pillager_camp_ruin(s) about 1.7x the r1031 / r1101 share; great_tower_siege about 0.6x; meteor_shower about 0.66x; eugene:pillager_camp, the great tower and ae2:meteorite counts within 15 % (same centre file)

