## SQ-MOB-N5 | lone villagers: plains creature list has minecraft:villager 1 (1-1); villagers in the plains square
> dumpspawns
sleep 10
shell python3 -c "import json; d=json.load(open('kubejs/exported/spawns.json')); b=d['biomes']; [print(k, [s for s in b[k]['spawners'].get('creature', []) if 'villager' in s['type']]) for k in ('minecraft:plains', 'minecraft:meadow')]; t=json.dumps(d.get('tuning', {})); print('lone_villagers' in t, t[t.find('lone_villagers'):t.find('lone_villagers')+160])"
shell python3 -c "import json,sys; d=json.load(open('kubejs/exported/spawns.json'))['biomes']; ok=any(s['type']=='minecraft:villager' and s['weight']==1 for s in d['minecraft:plains']['spawners'].get('creature', [])); print('plains villager 1:', ok); sys.exit(0 if ok else 1)"
shell python3 -I $INST/tools/scratch_query/region_blocks.py entities wge 'villager' --box {PL1-400} {PL3-400} {PL1+400} {PL3+400} | head -12
look villagers in the plains square outside villages (by_biome lines), none in caves; MCA conversion (MS-27, MS-28)

